WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.320
How does one cell divide into two sisters that are different from the moment they

2
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:10.820
are born? Take the sensory organ precursor of a fly.

3
00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:16.360
A bristle is a small sense organ of four cells, and all four come from this one

4
00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:20.200
precursor. It divides, and the two daughters take different paths.

5
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.300
One daughter goes on to make the neuron and its sheath.

6
00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.940
Its sister goes on to make the hair and its socket.

7
00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:31.530
Before division, a protein called Numb gathers on one half of the cell membrane.

8
00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:33.190
It forms a crescent.

9
00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:38.070
Scientists saw this by staining dividing cells with an antibody to Numb.

10
00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:42.270
When the cell divides, the crescent goes into one daughter only.

11
00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:44.330
The other daughter gets none.

12
00:00:45.183 --> 00:00:46.763
What does Numb act on?

13
00:00:47.403 --> 00:00:50.803
Notch is a receptor that signals only between touching cells.

14
00:00:51.403 --> 00:00:55.423
When it is activated, it is cut, and its inner part can switch genes on.

15
00:00:56.023 --> 00:00:59.923
The two sisters touch, so each could signal to the other through Notch.

16
00:01:00.763 --> 00:01:03.463
Numb switches off Notch in the daughter that inherits it.

17
00:01:03.903 --> 00:01:05.883
How it does this is still argued.

18
00:01:06.717 --> 00:01:08.897
The daughter with Numb cannot hear the message.

19
00:01:09.317 --> 00:01:12.897
Its sister can. The sister takes the Notch on, outer fate.

20
00:01:13.377 --> 00:01:15.157
It makes the hair and its socket.

21
00:01:15.597 --> 00:01:18.337
The daughter with Numb takes the Notch off, inner fate.

22
00:01:18.797 --> 00:01:20.837
It makes the neuron and its sheath.

23
00:01:21.357 --> 00:01:23.337
Numb does not tell the cell what to become.

24
00:01:23.957 --> 00:01:28.397
It is a private veto on a message from the sister, and it changes how the cell

25
00:01:28.397 --> 00:01:29.397
answers.

26
00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:31.210
Now test the idea.

27
00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:35.290
Remove Numb, and nothing blocks Notch in either daughter.

28
00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:37.750
Both daughters take the outer fate.

29
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:41.930
They make four outer support cells, all sockets, and no neuron.

30
00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:44.110
Now give Numb to both daughters.

31
00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:45.930
Neither can hear Notch.

32
00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:47.810
Both take the inner fate.

33
00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:50.170
They make neurons, and no bristle.

34
00:01:51.033 --> 00:01:52.693
That is the core of the idea.

35
00:01:53.573 --> 00:01:55.393
Numb gathers on one side of the cell.

36
00:01:56.073 --> 00:01:57.853
Division hands it to one daughter only.

37
00:01:58.453 --> 00:02:01.913
There it blocks Notch, while the sister still hears the signal.

38
00:02:02.533 --> 00:02:06.753
Remember the rule: Numb goes to one daughter only, so the sisters differ.
